  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <!-- Tabs -->\n<div> <ul> <li data-tab=\"overview\">\n<a href=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/ti-84-evo\"> <span>TI-84 Evo</span>\n</a> </li> <li data-tab=\"online-calculator\">\n<a href=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/ti-84-evo/ti-84-evo-online-calculator\"> <span>Online calculator</span>\n</a> </li> <li data-tab=\"ti-connect-evo\">\n<a href=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/ti-84-evo/ti-connect-evo\"> <span>TI Connect™ Evo</span>\n</a> </li> <li data-tab=\"accessories\">\n<a href=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/ti-84-evo/accessories\"> <span>Accessories</span>\n</a> </li> <li data-tab=\"product-support\">\n<a href=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/ti-84-evo/evo-product-support\"> <span>Support</span>\n</a> </li> </ul> </div>\n<!-- /Tabs --> <!-- Solo Hero Wide -->\n<div><p>​\n</p><div> <h2>Evolved to do everything better</h2> <p><a href=\"#lightbox=TI-84Evo-promo\">See what’s new <span></span></a> </p></div><p>​</p></div>\n<!-- End Solo Hero Wide -->\n\n<!-- Content Block Wide -->\n<div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/overview-approved-for-exams.png?rev=8fabd06f-1c25-48af-8a49-4ee470bff447&amp;la=en&amp;h=65&amp;w=420&amp;hash=361748DFF400CC32D3CE8BF1B1BA54E0\" alt=\"\"> </p> </div>\n<!-- End Content Block Wide --> <!-- Content Group Wide --> <!-- /Content Group Wide --> <!-- Content Block Wide -->\n<div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/overview-evo-animated-screen-math-tools-v2.gif?rev=3e5c20f1-f86c-4050-9cb5-9230c63a8684&amp;la=en&amp;h=420&amp;w=480&amp;hash=C7678842D23A4F35210353A5A2B4B4AF\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div> <h2>The math tools you use most, <br>right up front</h2> <p>The TI-84 Evo introduces a new icon-based home screen that puts the most popular math tools in plain view. Find what you need in seconds with intuitive navigation that’s organized for clarity and speed. </p> </div> </div>\n<!-- End Content Block Wide --> <!-- Content Group Wide -->\n\n<div data-items-per-row=\"3\"> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/icons-features_lm-03.jpg?rev=a2c3d27e-565d-424b-9dd7-b4796489a417&amp;la=en&amp;h=75&amp;w=75&amp;hash=00FCF7CCA6D121519B35644B98392CE1\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div> <p> <h4>3x faster processor</h4> </p> </div> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/icons-features_lm-02.jpg?rev=0c897d55-dbf7-4400-b849-11d56f9387c7&amp;la=en&amp;h=75&amp;w=76&amp;hash=096493C049E8DC95F703067805544CE4\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div> <p> <h4>50% more<br> graphing area</h4> </p> </div> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/icons-features_lm-01.jpg?rev=7eeb4345-462b-4953-aa48-959bb91c5f7e&amp;la=en&amp;h=75&amp;w=75&amp;hash=C168B2FFAD5AEEC80E60C69A3494DFA9\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div> <p> <h4>USB-C port</h4> </p> </div> </div> </div>\n<!-- /Content Group Wide --> <!-- Content Group Wide -->\n\n<div data-items-per-row=\"2\"> <div> <p>\n<h2>Get to the math faster</h2> </p> </div> <div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/evo-keyboard.png?rev=442e00b9-1120-42dd-b83d-b6ad97820d80&amp;la=en&amp;h=403&amp;w=500&amp;hash=0BC42C2DBBF1A1421396A59A27567EA2\" alt=\"Evo keypad\"> </p> <div> <h3>Simplified keypad</h3> <p>The keypad layout removes clutter and makes commands and shortcuts easier to see, so you can work faster with fewer steps. </p> </div> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/overview-smarter-menus-v2.gif?rev=07301c16-3194-4190-83ce-03c98e136d8b&amp;la=en&amp;h=403&amp;w=500&amp;hash=5C3DE592A828506C3B6A5763D58D3F39\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div> <h3>Smarter menus</h3> <p>The menu system organizes tools into clear categories and subcategories, making it easy to find exactly what you need.</p> </div> </div> </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /Content Group Wide --> <!-- Content Block Wide -->\n<div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/overview-context-help-bar.jpg?rev=c08de3aa-c467-498c-b305-b87c57e58f62&amp;la=en&amp;h=348&amp;w=460&amp;hash=9EC0487565683528F80DA63E9D2675F5\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div> <h2>Built-in help, right when you need it</h2> <p>The TI-84 Evo is intelligently designed to guide you as you go. The yellow status bar pops up to provide helpful hints, without giving away answers. </p> </div> </div>\n<!-- End Content Block Wide --> <!-- CardCarousel --> <div> <p>\n\n<h2>Not just an upgrade — an EVOlution</h2> <h4>New and improved features for a better experience</h4> </p> <div data-items-per-row=\"1\"> <!-- Card item --> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/ti-84-evo/ti-84-evo-raspberry_fr_poi-trace_503px-v2ani.gif?rev=d75955c5-34b8-40ad-8894-fa4fa48f0aec&amp;la=en&amp;h=420&amp;w=503&amp;hash=A0911BF6348373C7F3D2A4FD81FECE3A\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div>\n\n<h4>New! Points of Interest Trace</h4> <p>The points of interest are highlighted as you trace a function, making analysis of functions easier and more interactive.</p> </div> </div> <!-- Card item --> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/ti-84-evo/33539_84-evo_white-503px-v2.png?rev=e363ab1c-ff7e-405b-98f8-dbff795bed5d&amp;la=en&amp;h=420&amp;w=503&amp;hash=D845CB852AFB1A4AC1ACDBFE10D24F35\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div>\n\n<h4>Redesigned Lines and Conics App</h4> <p>Add equation templates, trace function intersections, and explore relationships across multiple conics in an instant.</p> </div> </div> <!-- Card item --> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/ti-84-evo/34359_ti-84-evo-iris_front_503px_v2ani.gif?rev=8bf8dbdb-e0e8-4f36-95c9-d154bb3bf4a6&amp;la=en&amp;h=420&amp;w=503&amp;hash=2FDCDF83E943A751866C2ACE5642A537\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div>\n<h4>Faster Points of Intersection</h4> <p>When dealing with just two functions, skip the setup and jump straight to the intersection —fewer steps, faster results.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div>\n\n<!-- /CardCarousel --> <!-- Content Block Wide -->\n<div> <h2>Solve math problems in style</h2> <p><a href=\"https://education.ti.com/en/purchase/where-to-buy?category=graphing\" target=\"_blank\">Find your color</a></p><div> <!-- Hidden Radio Inputs --> <!-- Images Section - White --> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Evo-Carousel-HHs-Mobile/TI-84-Evo-white_mob-carousel.png\"> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Derivative-Slide-White.jpg\"> </p> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Evo-Carousel-HHs-Mobile/TI-84-Evo-pink_mob-carousel.png\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Pink\"> <img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Derivative-Slide-Pink.jpg\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Pink\"> </p> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Evo-Carousel-HHs-Mobile/TI-84-Evo-mint_mob-carousel.png\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Mint\"> <img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Derivative-Slide-Mint.jpg\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Mint\"> </p> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Evo-Carousel-HHs-Mobile/TI-84-Evo-raspberry_mob-carousel.png\" alt=\"TI 84 Evo Pink Front Faster Lines\"> <img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Derivative-Slide-Raspberry.jpg\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Pink\"> </p> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Evo-Carousel-HHs-Mobile/TI-84-Evo-gray_mob-carousel.png\" alt=\"Derivative Slide White\"> <img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Derivative-Slide-Silver.jpg\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Silver\"> </p> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Evo-Carousel-HHs-Mobile/TI-84-Evo-teal_mob-carousel.png\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Teal\"> <img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Derivative-Slide-Teal.jpg\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Teal\"> </p> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Evo-Carousel-HHs-Mobile/TI-84-Evo-lavender_mob-carousel.png\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Lavender\"> <img src=\"https://education.ti.com/en/products/calculators/graphing-calculators/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/Derivative-Slide-Lavender.jpg\" alt=\"Derivative Slide Lavender\"> </p> <!-- Descriptions --> <!--<p class=\"color-desc\" data-color=\"white\">White - Replace the description</p> <p class=\"color-desc\" data-color=\"pink\">Pink–to freshen up your math class.</p> <p class=\"color-desc\" data-color=\"mint\">Mint - Replace the description</p> <p class=\"color-desc\" data-color=\"raspberry\">Raspberry - Replace the description</p> <p class=\"color-desc\" data-color=\"silver\">Silver - Replace the description</p> <p class=\"color-desc\" data-color=\"teal\">Teal - Replace the description</p> <p class=\"color-desc\" data-color=\"lavender\">Lavender - Replace the description</p>--> <!-- Descriptions --> <p data-color=\"white\"> <strong>Classics never go out of style</strong><br> <strong>White:</strong> Clean and crisp — a timeless look for every class\n</p> <p data-color=\"pink\"> <strong>Bright, brainy and impossible to miss</strong><br> <strong>Pink:</strong> A punchy pick for those who show up loud and proud\n</p> <p data-color=\"mint\"> <strong>A fresh perspective for every day</strong><br> <strong>Mint:</strong> Cool, confident, and ready to learn in style </p> <p data-color=\"raspberry\"> <strong>Calculate vividly and fearlessly</strong><br> <strong>Raspberry:</strong> Add a pop of personality that stands out </p> <p data-color=\"silver\"> <strong>Sleek, sharp and ready to shine</strong><br> <strong>Silver:</strong> Bring futuristic energy to every math class </p> <p data-color=\"teal\"> <strong>Math with a cool edge</strong><br> <strong>Teal:</strong> A sharp shade that adds personality without distractions </p> <p data-color=\"lavender\"> <strong>Soft vibes with strong math energy</strong><br> <strong>Lavender:</strong> A calming color for solving the toughest problems </p> <!-- Color Tab Swatches --> </div> </div>\n<!-- End Content Block Wide --> <!-- Content Group Vertical Wide -->\n<div> <div> <p>\n<h2>Built to be a reliable learning tool, not a distraction</h2> </p> </div> <div> <p><img src=\"https://education.ti.com/-/media/ti/education/images/products/product-details/graphing/84-series/84-evo-shared/overview-learning-tool-teacher-selfie.png?rev=ff8c8434-1e44-4754-9a31-2a61e79dcbea&amp;la=en&amp;h=370&amp;w=500&amp;hash=CA20D0537717F88D923913E179586DE6\" alt=\"\"> </p> <div> <p>In a world full of online distractions, the TI-84 Evo sets the standard for staying focused. No online drift. No off-task detours. Just a dedicated, distraction-free learning tool for classrooms and high-stakes exams.</p>\n<p>With hardware that’s extra tough to withstand everyday use, TI-84 Evo stays dependable year after year, for every mathematical journey&nbsp;— from middle school to high school, college, and beyond.</p> </div> </div>\n\n</div>\n<!-- /Content Group Vertical Wide --> <!-- Content Block Wide -->\n<div> <h2>See how the TI-84 Evo gives you more</h2> <div>\n<!-- <div class=\"Rtable Rtable--4cols Rtable-header\">\n<div class=\"Rtable-cell feature\" style=\"width: 2%;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"Rtable-cell\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"Rtable-cell\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"Rtable-cell\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div> -->\n\n<div>\n<p><strong>Processor speed</strong></p>\n<p>156 MHz</p>\n<p>48 MHz</p>\n<p>15 MHz</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Graphing display area</strong></p>\n<p>319 x 209</p>\n<p>264 x 165</p>\n<p>96 x 64</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>User available memory</strong></p>\n<p>3.5 MB</p>\n<p>3 MB</p>\n<p>480 KB</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Cable included</strong></p>\n<p>USB-C</p>\n<p>USB-mini</p>\n<p>USB-mini</p>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong>Protective slide case</strong></p>\n<p>•</p>\n<p>•</p>\n<p>•</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Color, backlit display</strong></p>\n<p>•</p>\n<p>•</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong>Online calculator included (four-year subscription)</strong></p> </div>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong>Connects to STEM accessories</strong></p>\n<p>•</p> </div>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong>Simple, icon navigation</strong></p>\n<p>•</p> </div>\n</div> </div>\n<!-- End Content Block Wide -->\n\n<!-- Bubble Banner Wide -->\n\n<!-- End Bubble Banner Wide --> <!-- Accordion Wide -->\n\n<!-- /Accordion Wide --> <!-- Footnote -->\n\n<!-- /Footnote --> </div></div>",
